  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il construit des nids en os. Il attrape\nles proies affaiblies avec ses serres\net les transporte allègrement au nid.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It makes a nest out of bones it finds.\nIt grabs weakened prey in its talons\nand hauls it to its nest of bones.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il guette le sol depuis les airs et\nfond sur les proies affaiblies.\nIl aime s’apprêter avec des ossements.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Watching from the sky, they swoop to\nstrike weakened Pokémon on the ground.\nThey decorate themselves with bones.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They fly in circles around the sky.\nWhen they spot prey, they attack and\ncarry it back to their nest with ease.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They fly in circles around the sky.\nWhen they spot prey, they attack and\ncarry it back to their nest with ease.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおぞらで　えんをえがきつつ　とび\nえものを　みつけると　おそいかかって\nすまで　かるがると　はこんでいく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "넓은 하늘에서 원을 그리며 날고\n먹이를 발견하면 덮쳐서\n둥지까지 가뿐히 나른다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il tournoie dans les airs en quête d’une proie sur\nlaquelle il fondra avant de l’emporter avec aisance\nà son nid.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kreist am Himmel, bis es seine Beute findet.\nNach erfolgtem Angriff trägt es sie mühelos zu\nseinem Nest.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vuela en círculos. Cuando avista una presa, la ataca y\nla transporta a su nido con suma facilidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vola in cerchio nel cielo e quando scorge una preda\nle si lancia contro in picchiata per trasportarla al suo\nnido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They fly in circles around the sky. When they spot\nprey, they attack and carry it back to their nest\nwith ease.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大空で　円を描きつつ　飛び\n獲物を　みつけると　襲いかかって\n巣まで　軽々と　運んでいく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vuela en círculos. Cuando avista una presa, la ataca y\nla transporta a su nido con suma facilidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "そらから　ちじょうを　かんさつして\nよわった　えものに　おそいかかる。\nほねで　きかざる　しゅうせい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "하늘에서 지상을 관찰하다\n쇠약해진 먹이를 덮친다.\n뼈로 몸치장하는 습성이 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il guette le sol depuis les airs et fond sur les proies\naffaiblies. Il aime s’apprêter avec des ossements.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es überblickt das Areal aus der Luft und stürzt sich auf\nein geschwächtes Opfer. Trägt gern Knochenschmuck.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Otea la superficie desde el cielo y ataca a Pokémon\ndebilitados. Tiene por costumbre hacerse adornos\ncon huesos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Osserva la terra dal cielo e si lancia sulle prede in\ndifficoltà. Ha l’abitudine di farsi delle decorazioni\ncon le ossa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Watching from the sky, they swoop to strike\nweakened Pokémon on the ground. They decorate\nthemselves with bones.",
